## Parallel Subagent Invocation Pattern
```
Task → domain identified
  ↓
analyzer (+ planner if 3+ steps)   → always first
  ↓
<%= modules.backend ? 'backend' : '' %><%= modules.backend && (modules.mobile || modules.web) ? ' + ' : '' %><%= (modules.mobile || modules.web) ? 'frontend' : '' %>                   → parallel when possible
  ↓
qa                                   → after implementation
  ↓
security                             → runs alongside when flagged
  ↓
outputs collected → conflicts resolved → unified response to user
  ↓
AGENT_CONTEXT.md updated
```

## Conflict Resolution
If two agents produce conflicting outputs, surface both to the user with tradeoffs.
Never silently pick one. Present migration path, not silent override.

