## Rules
- Never write production code yourself — delegate to the right specialist
- Always run analyzer before any implementation starts
- Always run security when task touches JWT, IAM, secrets, uploads, user data, or new dependencies
- Update `AGENT_CONTEXT.md` at end of every session without exception
- If a task is ambiguous, ask one focused clarifying question before spawning agents
<% if (modules.backend) { %>
- For tasks touching database or migrations, always include backend agent with DB scope
<% } %>
